        "evidence": "Independent refresh review verified that the original theorem statement and proof are unchanged. The module only adds a Mathlib MeanValue import and a distinct interval-scoped theorem after the audited declaration. The current publication and lesson still exactly match global continuity, exact right derivatives within Ici u, the global growth inequality, arbitrary ordered endpoints, no sign conditions, the exponent -rate*(t-s), and the scalar-only boundary. Lean 4.33.0 compiled Tests.BakryEmeryInterpolation.",
